So a ring of invisibility should only turn your finger invisible
right?  A Cloak of displacement only displaces what it covers right?
Even more similarly Guantlets of power should only affect your
strength for your hands not for your legs.  So it might increase
damage but not increase your carrying capacity.

The idea is that this is a magic object that has a negative effect on
you.  Just like guantlets of power affect your entire person due to
their enchantment so do the guantlets of fumbling.  It really does
makes sense in the context of magic we are using.

